&kp HOME        &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW  &kp END  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp HOME  &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW  &kp END 
