          JIS {
            bindings = <
&kp Q             &kp W             &kp E            &kp R           &kp T                                                    &kp Y          &kp U           &kp I        &kp O      &kp P
&kp A             &kp S        &mt RIGHT_ALT D       &mt RCTRL F     &kp G       &kp C_MUTE  &kp LG(V)  &to O   &trans       &kp H          &kp J           &kp K        &kp L      &moSEMI
&mt_exit_AML_on_tap LEFT_SHIFT Z  &kp X   &kp C      &kp V           &kp B       &tog JNUM                      &trans   &kp N          &kp M           &kp COMMA    &kp DOT    &mt RIGHT_SHIFT SLASH
&kp LCTRL         &kp LEFT_WIN      &kp LEFT_ALT     &mt LCTRL DEL   &lt JNUM SPACE  &lt JSYM DEL         &kp BACKSPACE     &mt LEFT_SHIFT ENTER                      &mo BT     &lt WARR LA(GRAVE)

